# Nothing else needs listing here: the app's state directory lives OUTSIDE the
# repo, at ~/.file-organiser-agent/ (see organiser/paths.py). Saved plans
# (~/.file-organiser-agent/plans/) and the undo log
# (~/.file-organiser-agent/undo-log.jsonl) therefore can never be committed by
# accident — they are records of one machine's real files, not source.
